[Q]
text: What do the students think about research into the impact of nutritional food labelling?
A: It did not produce clear results.
B: It focused on the wrong people.
C: It made unrealistic recommendations.
answer: A
loc: Those findings weren't that conclusive
exp: Alice nói các phát hiện không mang tính kết luận và nghiên cứu quy mô nhỏ; Jack đồng ý.

