- In Java, coffee was used as a form of ___
- Coffee became almost as important as ___
- The move towards the consumption of ___ in Britain did not also take place in the USA.
Coffee in the 19th century
- Prices dropped because of improvements in ___
- Industrial workers found coffee helped them to work at ___

